Reran the exact saved SPY/QQQ snapshot (dataset b0e94186f465bc47) through the
fixed pipeline in an isolated copy (no download, no new snapshot write).

### Outcome: baseline economics reconcile exactly with the audit's recorded
post-fix baseline (net Sharpe -0.064856, net return -5.16%, 1764 OOS intervals,
AUC/Brier delta = 0.0).  This confirms the B06/B13/B14/B15 fixes introduce
no economic delta to the price-only baseline.

- all_executed_ledger_values_finite: true
